  "description": "PS3Sharp is a .NET library for reading and writing memory directly from PlayStation 3 (PS3) consoles and the RPCS3 emulator. It offers easy-to-use backends to interact with PS3 memory, making it ideal for tooling, debugging, and modding projects targeting both PS3 hardware and the RPCS3 emulator.",
